board, kindness rehearsed,"},{"s":24.66,"e":30.98,"text":"Says, “Tell me what you saw when the whole world reversed.”"},{"s":30.98,"e":36.66,"text":"Alice bites her tongue till she tastes something red,"},{"s":36.66,"e":38.91,"text":"“There was a rabbit.”"},{"s":38.91,"e":41.58,"text":"He circles what she said."},{"s":41.58,"e":44.26,"text":"“No tunnels. No kingdoms."},{"s":44.26,"e":47.05,"text":"No queen dressed in black."},{"s":47.05,"e":49.4,"text":"No watches, no voices,"},{"s":49.4,"e":51.97,"text":"No looking-glass cracks."},{"s":51.97,"e":54.12,"text":"You want to go home?"},{"s":54.12,"e":56.8,"text":"Then give us the answer.”"},{"s":56.8,"e":58.4,"text":"Alice whispers—"},{"s":58.4,"e":61.51,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":61.51,"e":64.51,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":64.51,"e":66.76,"text":"No message inside it,"},{"s":66.76,"e":69.01,"text":"No doorway behind it,"},{"s":69.01,"e":73.93,"text":"No reason on earth I should follow or grab it."},{"s":73.93,"e":77.04,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":77.04,"e":79.61,"text":"Say it like you mean it."},{"s":79.61,"e":81.97,"text":"Say it till it's true."},{"s":81.97,"e":84.32,"text":"Say it for the doctors"},{"s":84.32,"e":86.79,"text":"Who know more than you."},{"s":86.79,"e":90,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":90,"e":93.75,"text":"And maybe they'll give me my shoes."},{"s":93.75,"e":97.93,"text":"Tuesday tastes exactly like Monday did,"},{"s":97.93,"e":103.07,"text":"She counts ceiling tiles like a good little kid."},{"s":103.07,"e":108.21,"text":"Group room confession underneath buzzing lights:"},{"s":108.21,"e":110.57,"text":"“What is real, Alice?”"},{"s":110.57,"e":113.89,"text":"She says, “Whatever you write.”"},{"s":113.89,"e":119.67,"text":"The girl down the hallway says, “Don't fight the tide."},{"s":119.67,"e":124.49,"text":"They don't need you certain, just certified.”"},{"s":124.49,"e":129.74,"text":"Then she taps on the wall—three knocks, then two—"},{"s":129.74,"e":132.1,"text":"Alice hears scratching"},{"s":132.1,"e":133.6,"text":"From Room 302."},{"s":133.6,"e":136.28,"text":"“No tunnels. No kingdoms."},{"s":136.28,"e":138.42,"text":"No tea at half-past."},{"s":138.42,"e":141.31,"text":"The things that you dreamed"},{"s":141.31,"e":144.31,"text":"Are a symptom that's passed."},{"s":144.31,"e":147.1,"text":"You want your own clothes?"},{"s":147.1,"e":149.77,"text":"You want your old habits?"},{"s":149.77,"e":151.81,"text":"Then say it again.”"},{"s":151.81,"e":153.31,"text":"So Alice says—"},{"s":153.31,"e":156.42,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":156.42,"e":159.42,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":159.42,"e":162.2,"text":"Its eyes aren't a warning,"},{"s":162.2,"e":164.77,"text":"It doesn't know my name,"},{"s":164.77,"e":167.88,"text":"And clocks don't run backward"},{"s":167.88,"e":170.02,"text":"No matter the panic."},{"s":170.02,"e":173.13,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":173.13,"e":175.38,"text":"I know how to say it."},{"s":175.38,"e":177.73,"text":"I'm learning the tune."},{"s":177.73,"e":179.77,"text":"Morning medication,"},{"s":179.77,"e":181.38,"text":"Dinner at noon."},{"s":181.38,"e":184.59,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":184.59,"e":188.34,"text":"Now please let me out of this room."},{"s":188.34,"e":189.94,"text":"Rabbit, rabbit—"},{"s":189.94,"e":191.55,"text":"Nothing to see."},{"s":191.55,"e":193.16,"text":"Rabbit, rabbit—"},{"s":193.16,"e":194.77,"text":"Nothing but me."},{"s":194.77,"e":196.37,"text":"Rabbit, rabbit—"},{"s":196.37,"e":198.19,"text":"Four little feet."},{"s":198.19,"e":200.66,"text":"Then why do I hear them"},{"s":200.66,"e":202.69,"text":"Running underneath?"},{"s":202.69,"e":207.73,"text":"Her mother comes Sunday with tears in her eyes,"},{"s":207.73,"e":212.87,"text":"Says, “Baby, just tell them whatever they like.”"},{"s":212.87,"e":218.55,"text":"Alice says, “What if pretending is part of the trap?”"},{"s":218.55,"e":221.54,"text":"Her mother squeezes tighter:"},{"s":221.54,"e":224.22,"text":"“Just get yourself back.”"},{"s":224.22,"e":225.94,"text":"But which Alice?"},{"s":225.94,"e":228.4,"text":"The one before falling?"},{"s":228.4,"e":230.54,"text":"The one after pills?"},{"s":230.54,"e":233.76,"text":"The one who stopped screaming?"},{"s":233.76,"e":236.11,"text":"The one sitting still?"},{"s":236.11,"e":238.47,"text":"If sanity's a password"},{"s":238.47,"e":240.4,"text":"Printed on a page,"},{"s":240.4,"e":242.75,"text":"Is freedom being free—"},{"s":242.75,"e":245.43,"text":"Or saying the right thing"},{"s":245.43,"e":248.22,"text":"To whoever holds the cage?"},{"s":248.22,"e":253.47,"text":"So Alice stands straight when the doctors arrive."},{"s":253.47,"e":255.61,"text":"Hair neatly brushed."},{"s":255.61,"e":256.89,"text":"Voice quiet."},{"s":256.89,"e":257.86,"text":"Eyes dry."},{"s":257.86,"e":260.43,"text":"“Do you understand now?”"},{"s":260.43,"e":261.61,"text":"She smiles."},{"s":261.61,"e":262.46,"text":"“I do.”"},{"s":262.46,"e":264.82,"text":"“What was the rabbit?”"},{"s":264.82,"e":266,"text":"“A rabbit.”"},{"s":266,"e":267.61,"text":"“Nothing more?”"},{"s":267.61,"e":269.21,"text":"“Nothing more.”"},{"s":269.21,"e":271.57,"text":"The pen makes a check."},{"s":271.57,"e":274.03,"text":"The lock makes a sound."},{"s":274.03,"e":276.71,"text":"And somewhere inside her,"},{"s":276.71,"e":279.6,"text":"Something goes underground."},{"s":279.6,"e":282.71,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":282.71,"e":285.71,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":285.71,"e":287.85,"text":"No prophecy, portal,"},{"s":287.85,"e":290.1,"text":"No beautiful madness,"},{"s":290.1,"e":294.39,"text":"No universe hiding inside of the static."},{"s":294.39,"e":297.49,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":297.49,"e":299.64,"text":"I said it correctly."},{"s":299.64,"e":301.78,"text":"You opened the door."},{"s":301.78,"e":304.35,"text":"You gave back my jacket,"},{"s":304.35,"e":306.7,"text":"My name, and my phone."},{"s":306.7,"e":309.7,"text":"The rabbit is only a rabbit."},{"s":309.7,"e":312.92,"text":"I don't chase rabbits anymore."},{"s":312.92,"e":315.6,"text":"She walks past reception."},{"s":315.6,"e":317.74,"text":"Past security glass."},{"s":317.74,"e":320.2,"text":"Past the sign that says"},{"s":320.2,"e":322.45,"text":"RECOVERY IS POSSIBLE."},{"s":322.45,"e":323.31,"text":"Outside—"},{"s":323.31,"e":324.59,"text":"October air."},{"s":324.59,"e":325.45,"text":"Cars."},{"s":325.45,"e":326.31,"text":"People."},{"s":326.31,"e":328.13,"text":"Ordinary morning."},{"s":328.13,"e":330.49,"text":"Alice closes her eyes."},{"s":330.49,"e":331.45,"text":"Breathes."},{"s":331.45,"e":332.63,"text":"Opens them."},{"s":332.63,"e":335.09,"text":"Across the parking lot,"},{"s":335.09,"e":336.7,"text":"Something white"},{"s":336.7,"e":338.84,"text":"slips behind a tree."},{"s":338.84,"e":340.34,"text":"Two long ears."},{"s":340.34,"e":341.41,"text":"A flicker."},{"s":341.41,"e":342.27,"text":"Gone."},{"s":342.27,"e":344.52,"text":"Alice doesn't follow."},{"s":344.52,"e":346.77,"text":"She smiles to herself"},{"s":346.77,"e":348.16,"text":"and whispers:"},{"s":348.16,"e":351.37,"text":"“The rabbit is only a rabbit.”"},{"s":351.37,"e":353.94,"text":"Three steps toward home."},{"s":353.94,"e":356.41,"text":"Then, under her breath—"},{"s":356.41,"e":358.77,"text":"“But nobody ever asked"},{"s":358.77,"e":362.3,"text":"what the rabbit thinks of Alice.”"}],"duration":362.8,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}